# i18n and RTL

- Locales: `en` (default), `fr`, `he`. All user-visible strings go through i18next. No raw English (or any language) in TSX.
- Set `lang` and `dir` on `<html>`. Hebrew uses `dir="rtl"`.
- Language switcher `EN · FR · עב` stays visible on every viewport.
- Do not translate proper nouns or protocol names (SAML, SCIM, SSO, LDAP, Entra ID).
- Persist the chosen locale (localStorage). First visit may follow `navigator.language`.
- Test layout in RTL: no clipped text, no leftover `margin-left` / `text-align: left` on mirrored chrome.
